<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Black Tiger I, 2015</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;A Fictional February, 2015&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;After beating Senator Obama in the race for the White House in 2008,&amp;nbsp;second-term&amp;nbsp;President Ronald&amp;nbsp;Taggart has maintained U.S. involvement on the ground in Iraq until early 2015,&amp;nbsp;at which time&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;remaining U.S. ground forces are withdrawing through Kuwait. The last marines have embarked in the USS &lt;EM&gt;Tarawa&lt;/EM&gt; Expeditionary Strike Group, which will soon be transiting the Strait of Hormuz to head back home. Carrier Strike Group THREE, centered on USS &lt;EM&gt;Carl Vinson,&lt;/EM&gt; is&amp;nbsp;finishing up a strenuous 7 month deployment and will be transiting with the &lt;EM&gt;Tarawa&lt;/EM&gt; ESG.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Unfortunately, the Iranians have been far more belligerent lately than in past months. Harsh economic sanctions are taking a toll, and tensions continue to rise over their ongoing nuclear program.&amp;nbsp;A stagnant economy and the falling price of oil has put them in an economic quagmire. A resurgent Russia has aligned itself closely with Tehran, also beset economically by low oil prices. It is not lost on anyone that strife in the Persian Gulf is something sure to send oil prices back up- as well as a way for Russia's strongman president to make life difficult for his old nemesis, the United States, by using Iran as a proxy of sorts. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;In order to aid their new allies against the United States, her allies, and particularly Israel, Russia has recently&amp;nbsp;engaged in a modern day lend-lease program of sorts with Iran. The Russians have provided several regiments of front line fighters to the Iranians, along with valuable AWACS assets, weapons, &amp;nbsp;and the components of a world class integrated air defense system. With these tools in hand, the Iranians are ratcheting tensions to a new all time high...&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
